# THE VINE'S OWN ISLANDS ARE BUILD OUTPUT HERE, NOT SOURCE.
#
# Ruled by Ash 2026-09-04 (docs/ops/BRIEF-YEAR-ONE.md, WHERE IT LIVES): the
# opening and the Maw are written in blhs-islands and never again in this repo.
# `scripts/vendor-islands.mjs` writes these two folders at dev, test and build
# time from that repository. Committing them would put an editable second copy
# back exactly where the ruling took one away, and the next person to fix a line
# would fix it in the copy the player never sees.
#
# The fixtures beside them (hello, broken, maw-demo) ARE this repo's own and
# stay tracked. The vendor never touches those.
public/grapes/panther-maw/
public/grapes/castaway/
public/grapes/the-hub/
public/grapes/atc/
!scripts/vendor-platform.mjs
# vendored copies of the platform, refreshed at dev, test and build; never committed
public/maps-vendored/
public/world-vendored/
public/ui-vendored/
